  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When enabling OSC, it will cause the avatar to reload up to the amount of players in the current instance.\nCausing some strange local position update effect.\nIt's more noticeable the higher the player count is. As shown in the video with 80~ people. \nhttps://share.phaxe.com/file/2022-9/Racer_oaDDV4UwRC.mp4\n\nSteps:\n- Load into an instance with high player count\n- Enable OSC\n- See local position change a few times and avatar reload\n- Once done, it'll settle and return to normal.\n\n\nThis only happens on enable.",
